invalid type: string "Tan Skin Tones\n\n### General Direction\n- Warm, earthy and jewel tones often show clear definition against tan skin, and light colors can look crisp.\n\n### Colors to Experiment With\n- Neutrals: white, cream, olive, khaki, charcoal.\n- Reds: deep red, terracotta, brick, chili.\n- Blues: cobalt, turquoise, teal, royal blue.\n- Greens: emerald, forest, lime as an accent.\n.\n